{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Reviewing Peter's Progress", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "headway", "type": "name"}, {"content": "progress", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Have you made some good headway?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when reviewing a proposal. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "flair", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a natural ability to do something well", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You have a flair for presenting our company.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "track record", "type": "name"}, {"content": "all the past achievements, successes or failures of a person or company", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our company has a great track record.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to underscore", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to emphasize", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We need to underscore our successes.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "blow a budget", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to spend too much money on a single thing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's known for blowing a budget.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "it's covered", "type": "name"}, {"content": "it is taken care of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Don't worry, it's covered. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Giving Oral Instructions ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " In the workplace, it is important to give instructions to other co-workers and employees. In order for you to give someone instructions for doing something, you need to use the<span class=\"strong\"> imperative</span>. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The<span class=\"strong\"> imperative </span>is the standard form to use. The understood pronoun is <span class=\"italic\">\u201cyou\u201d</span>, but it is omitted. The <span class=\"strong\">imperative</span> form is the same as the<span class=\"strong\"> bare infinitive</span>. It has the same form for both singular and plural. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Mention him. </li><li>Remember to write the report.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the negative form, use \u201cdo not + verb\u201d or the contracted form \u201cdon't + verb\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Example</span>:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Don't mention him. </li><li>Don't forget to write the report.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The Imperative is used to: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li>Give instructions</li></ol><ul><li><span class=\"italic\">Work with what we have given you.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol start=\"2\"><li>Give commands</li></ol><ul><li><span class=\"italic\">Underscore our strengths.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol start=\"3\"><li>To make a polite request</li></ol><ul><li><span class=\"italic\">Please mention him.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Using the Present Perfect and the Simple Past Tense ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the <span class=\"strong\"> Present Perfect</span> tense to show a <span class=\"strong\"> connection </span> between the <span class=\"strong\"> past </span> and the <span class=\"strong\"> present</span>.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The <span class=\"strong\"> Present Perfect </span>is used when the action happened at an <span class=\"underline\">indefinite</span> time in the past. In this case, we often use <span class=\"underline\">already</span>, <span class=\"underline\">ever</span>, <span class=\"underline\">never</span>, <span class=\"underline\">always</span>, <span class=\"underline\">yet</span> or <span class=\"underline\">just.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Examples:</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I have already discussed this with Janet.<br/> </span> <span class=\"italic\"> We have arrived at a decision.</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Unlike the <span class=\"strong\"> Present Perfect </span>, the <span class=\"strong\"> Simple Past </span> refers to a specific event completed in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Examples:</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">I finished writing the proposal.</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I sent you it yesterday.</span> ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to think it all through", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to weigh all your options carefully", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We've thought it all through and we've come to a decision.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "spendthrift ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who spends too much money, or wastes money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He's a spendthrift! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "none of your concern", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a matter that does not affect you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That project is none of your concern. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn6le14ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and research your favorite hobby. Find a short article about it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the article and review it. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "How could the writer have made the article stronger? What other information could they have included? What information should have been left out? ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 5-6 suggestions. Use the Present Perfect tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 2-3 instructions you could give the author. Use the imperative.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your sentences. Use them to write a paragraph.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I read my favorite hobby.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read and review a short article.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make suggestions on how to make the article stronger.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give instructions on how to make the article better.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le14ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le14ob10re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Miranda? Are you free now? You wanted to review my work before I left.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Come in Peter. Have you made some good headway?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think so. Your review of the meeting with Farmani certainly helped.<br/>"}, {"image": "engenn6le14ob10re2img06.jpg", "time": "14000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Good. Let's see ... Hmmm ... you have a flair for presenting our company and its track record. I would want to do business with us after reading this!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thank you. It's honest, of course.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes. But you concentrate so much on our experience in North America. Remember that we are also aware of the challenges of moving into a new world market.  Underscore our assets there. Janet and I have discussed moving Ferdinand into PR for this project. Mention him. He has extensive experience and knows the culture.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ferdi Rosado? Of course he'd be great but he'd blow any budget. He's a spendthrift! Isn't Farmani rather conservative in his spending?"}, {"image": "engenn6le14ob10re2img07.jpg", "time": "64000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: It's covered Peter. He'll be paired with Rocco.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That'll depress him!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: None of your concern, Peter. We've thought it all through. Just work with what we gave you. Farmani needs to be aware that we've prepared for the cultural stage even though we don't have as many Latinos on our team as Garcia. Present him with a convincing package. I know you can do it."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le14ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le14ob10r